{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stacking Up: A World in Progress</strong> is a casual physics based puzzle game where you need to stack items to form a chain that stands without falling for 3 seconds. Each stage has different hazards and obstacles that you need to work around or use to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPLETE THE STACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday items become your building blocks. Grab, rotate, and arrange items to form a stable stack in order to connect the starting area to the finish area. You'll need to make sure that your stack holds steady for 3 seconds in order to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/90ebb26e086fe0eba985cdde2bb52731.poster.avif?t=1774281771\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/90ebb26e086fe0eba985cdde2bb52731.webm?t=1774281771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/90ebb26e086fe0eba985cdde2bb52731.mp4?t=1774281771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T FALL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every stack is stable. If you want to reach the goal you'll have to build your stack wisely. Cutting too many corners or making it too top heavy could cause everything to come crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/cefd961478343f7367cf41821f5f3e5f.poster.avif?t=1774281771\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/cefd961478343f7367cf41821f5f3e5f.webm?t=1774281771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/cefd961478343f7367cf41821f5f3e5f.mp4?t=1774281771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NAVIGATE OBSTACLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage takes you into a different room with its own unique obstacles and hazards. A springy bed? An angry octopus? A TV that somehow lets you stack on top of its images? All of it, and much more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/3119b0190704c6ccd854f426f4d8392f.poster.avif?t=1774281771\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/3119b0190704c6ccd854f426f4d8392f.webm?t=1774281771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/3119b0190704c6ccd854f426f4d8392f.mp4?t=1774281771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE THE JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the point of all of this stacking, and what's with the little green guy? A world turtle hatchling named Topple was born in an unfortunate state.. he doesn't have a world to carry. He's found a globe that would do just the trick, it's just a little out of reach. Help him stack up items to get to it. Hopefully it won't find a way to evade his grasp.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/ebfa7686f4ab5f2e5a8f83de1466cf01.poster.avif?t=1774281771\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/ebfa7686f4ab5f2e5a8f83de1466cf01.webm?t=1774281771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/ebfa7686f4ab5f2e5a8f83de1466cf01.mp4?t=1774281771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Different stages with their own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple solutions to each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A funny lighthearted story</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133190?t=1774281771","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133190?t=1774281771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/6cd13e6c0cbab0ab217c8d4aa218a2c294d26b4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774281771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/6cd13e6c0cbab0ab217c8d4aa218a2c294d26b4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774281771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stacking Up: A World in Progress</strong> is a casual physics based puzzle 